{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09330","headline":"再游龙门怀旧侣 · 韦应物","name":"再游龙门怀旧侣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两山郁相对，晨策方上干。\n霭霭眺都城，悠悠俯清澜。\n邈矣二三子，兹焉屡游盘。\n良时忽已周，独往念前欢。\n好鸟始云至，衆芳亦未阑。\n遇物岂殊昔，慨伤自有端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09330.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09330","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}